-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §115: a non-academic first deputy who
-- completed a degree is placed on the academic first deputies' table — the
-- coefficient the full Y times the grade steps times the degree's addition
-- (5%, 15%, 25%); A = X × it; at the current level, the grade nearest at
-- or above; the personal supplement recomputed; §93's complexity
-- supplement kept.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `46`
IMPORT `86`

§ `115 שיבוץ בטבלת השכר לסגני מנהלים ראשונים אקדמאיים`

-- ¶1: "סגן מנהל ראשון כאמור בסעיף 75 (א) או (ג)" — §75 is the
-- non-academic principals'; the first deputies are §104's
-- (F-ofek-hadash-base-115-a; convention reading.misprint: §104(א) or (ג)).
@ref akn:art_115
`the section §115 names for its first deputies` MEANS 75
`115 names the principals' section for its first deputies` MEANS
    NOT (`the section §115 names for its first deputies` EQUALS 104)
#ASSERT `115 names the principals' section for its first deputies`

-- (א): "בשיעור הקידום בדרגות, כאמור בסעיף 97" — §97 is the conversion
-- formula, which has no grade steps; the advance before the degree is
-- §112's (F-ofek-hadash-base-115-b; read §112).
@ref akn:art_115__para_a akn:art_115__para_a/p2 akn:art_115__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_115__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_115__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `step of each grade` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      r IS A `non-academic principal's rank`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's coefficient to the B.A. table` y `step of each grade` r IS
    `a principal's coefficient to the B.A. table` y `step of each grade` r

`the section 115(א) names for the grade steps` MEANS 97
`115(א) names the conversion formula for the grade steps` MEANS
    NOT (`the section 115(א) names for the grade steps` EQUALS 112)
#ASSERT `115(א) names the conversion formula for the grade steps`

@ref akn:art_115__para_b akn:art_115__para_b/p2
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, coefficient IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's A to the B.A. table` x coefficient IS
    x TIMES coefficient

@ref akn:art_115__para_c
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER, `row of the current level` IS A LIST OF `grade cell`
GIVETH A MAYBE `grade cell`
DECIDE `a first deputy's placement after the degree` a `row of the current level` IS
    `the placement in the row` a `row of the current level`

-- (ד)–(ה): the supplement of §99 recomputed; §93's supplement kept. ¶2 of
-- (ה) points to the principals' example (§87) for the computation.
@ref akn:art_115__para_d akn:art_115__para_e akn:art_115__para_e/p2
GIVEN `had a complexity supplement under §93` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a first deputy keeps the complexity supplement` `had a complexity supplement under §93` IF
    `had a complexity supplement under §93`

#ASSERT ROUND (1000 TIMES `a first deputy's coefficient to the B.A. table` 0.2 (LIST 0.0875) `a senior certified principal`) EQUALS 1370
